{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_48_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_48","textTraditional":"一、十有九年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_48_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_48","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_48_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_48","textTraditional":"三、秋，公子結媵陳人之婦於鄄，遂及齊侯、宋公盟。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_48_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_48","textTraditional":"媵，淺事也，不志。此其志何也？辟要盟也。何以見其辟要盟也？媵，禮之輕者也。盟，國之重也，以輕事遂乎國重無說。其曰陳人之婦，略之也。其不日，數渝，惡之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_48_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_48","textTraditional":"四、夫人姜氏如莒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_48_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_48","textTraditional":"婦人既嫁，不踰竟，踰竟非正也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_48_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_48","textTraditional":"五、冬，齊人、宋人、陳人伐我西鄙。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_48_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_48","textTraditional":"其曰鄙，遠之也。其遠之何也？不以難邇我國也。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}